{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Pegz is a vibrant arcade  game inspired by pachinko and classic coin droppers. Launch balls, hit pegs to fill your energy bar, unlock new characters by collecting cards, and create combos in colorful pixel art levels. With a powerful custom level editor and endless replayability, Pixel Pegz offers a fresh, creative twist on a beloved genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Arcade Action:</strong> Launch balls and bounce through dynamic peg layouts, combining skill and luck for satisfying combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962650/extras/246975dc63382455b18f3ee9c355bea2.poster.avif?t=1759410381\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962650/extras/246975dc63382455b18f3ee9c355bea2.webm?t=1759410381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962650/extras/246975dc63382455b18f3ee9c355bea2.mp4?t=1759410381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Generation:</strong> Experience new challenges with procedurally generated levels and layouts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy Bar System:</strong> Hit pegs to fill your energy bar to earn card packs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buckets with Unique Effects:</strong> Interact with a variety of buckets, including shock, teleport, and many more buckets, each affecting gameplay in different ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Peg Types:</strong> Experiment with magnets, portals, lightning, shatter, and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Characters:</strong> Collect cards as you play to unlock unique pixel art characters, each with their own style and flair.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962650/extras/4019ad6d3de37384cd4f01c35310802c.poster.avif?t=1759410381\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962650/extras/4019ad6d3de37384cd4f01c35310802c.webm?t=1759410381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962650/extras/4019ad6d3de37384cd4f01c35310802c.mp4?t=1759410381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetic Customization:</strong> Personalize your experience with unlockable backgrounds, balls, and pillars that you purchase with score you earn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Level Editor:</strong> Build, play, and add your own levels to the main game with an intuitive drag-and-drop editor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962650/extras/d88098555f47e36f740e0f9c6b83c7c7.poster.avif?t=1759410381\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"http